        <section>3.1 Wiki Articles</section>
        <snippet>Every knowledge artifact is a markdown file following the Karpathy wiki pattern. Standard article format includes frontmatter (title, type, phase, status, maturity, created, updated, createdByEpic, createdByStory, tags) and sections (Purpose, Key Exports, Dependencies, Dependents, Signals, Missing Signals). File naming convention: knowledge/{phase}/{slug}.md where slug uses -- for path separators.</snippet>
