        <title>Mycelium-Labs Integration Architecture</title>
        <section>Phase 9 — Bootstrap Pipeline (Brownfield)</section>
        <snippet>One-time pipeline that reads an existing codebase and generates the initial wiki + graph. Scope: codebase scan agent (file tree to code articles), dependency extraction (import analysis to edges), decision inference (package.json, configs to decision articles), full Memgraph population from generated wiki.</snippet>
      </doc>
