        <title>Mycelium-Labs Integration Architecture</title>
        <section>4.2 Story Compilation Step</section>
        <snippet>Knowledge Compiler agent pattern: reads changed files, generates/updates wiki articles with frontmatter and [[wikilinks]], updates index.md and log.md. Allowed tools: Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep. This pattern is reused for the bootstrap scan agent with modifications for batch processing.</snippet>
      </doc>
