        <section>2. Architecture Overview</section>
        <snippet>Project workspace at /home/ubuntu/projects/{name}/ with knowledge/ directory structure: index.md, log.md, code/, decisions/, requirements/, discovery/, planning/, solutioning/, qa/, system/, archive/. Local metadata in .mycelium/ (compile-state.json, embeddings-queue.json).</snippet>
      </doc>
      <doc>
        <path>docs/concepts/mycelium-labs-architecture.md</path>
        <title>Mycelium-Labs Integration Architecture</title>
        <section>3.2 Memgraph Schema</section>
        <snippet>Edge types derived from [[wikilinks]] in articles. ## Dependencies maps to outgoing DEPENDS_ON edges. ## Dependents maps to incoming DEPENDS_ON edges. 8 relationship types total: DEPENDS_ON, DERIVED_FROM, INFORMS, REFINES, VALIDATES, SUPERSEDES, CONFLICTS_WITH, ENABLES.</snippet>
      </doc>
